y":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon intensifies nearby fires. Every foe within 60 feet that is taking persistent fire damage takes @Damage[3d6[fire]] damage.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Fz8PvluYRaCsuHjh.jmrC9phVteComdYb"}],"name":"Cinder Dragon (Young)","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":1},"int":{"mod":1},"str":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":2}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":29},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":210,"temp":0,"value":210},"immunities":[{"type":"fire"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"sleep"}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":120}],"value":40},"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":10}]},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["common","draconic","pyric"]},"level":{"value":10},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Among the largest and fiercest dragons, cinder dragons are typically volatile, demanding respect—even deference—from lesser creatures. Cinder dragons' appearance evokes their flame, often in scales with mixed patterns of red, orange, and yellow. Many cinder dragons dwell in active volcanoes and similarly fiery locales. Cinder dragons prefer treasures that can withstand the heat of their bodies and lairs, with gemstones, gold, and silver common among their hoards.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core 2"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"smoke vision","mod":20,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"acuity":"imprecise","range":60,"type":"scent"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":21},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":17},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":19}},"sk